  "status": "unclear",
  "medicines": [],
  "safety_warning": "Medicine name is unclear. Please consult a physical pharmacist."
}
```

Do not substitute similar-looking medicines.

Do not recommend alternative medicines.

Do not independently prescribe or modify a doctor's instructions.

Display extracted results as an interpretation that must be confirmed with a qualified pharmacist or prescribing clinician.

