## 10.3 Exact Timing

The sequence must preserve these values:

| Stage | Duration |
|---|---:|
| Intentional SOS hold | 2.5 seconds |
| Local siren | 10 seconds |
| Ambient recording | 20 seconds |

The backend SOS event must be submitted immediately after the 2.5-second hold succeeds.

Do not wait 30 additional seconds before notifying the dashboard.

